    <string name="eurise_report_osm_anon">Without an account it becomes an anonymous note that volunteers check. With your OSM account (Settings › OpenStreetMap) you can fix it yourself.</string>
    <string name="eurise_report_osm_account">It goes out as a note with your OSM account; you can also fix the map yourself with the editor.</string>
