    <string name="eurise_guide_foot">Opens from the flag while driving or by saying «Alfred, speed camera». No confirmation: the point and the direction are taken when you tap. Reports for OpenStreetMap leave at the end of the trip, after a look at the list (anonymous note: position, type and direction, nothing else). Short ones stay on the phone and disappear after two hours.</string>
